  "name": "WF-06 · Dashboard & Data API",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-06 · Dashboard & Data API\n\n**Credentials needed:** every Postgres node below uses your Supabase Postgres credential.\n\n**File paths:** the 3 'Read ... Page' nodes read HTML from disk with n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile. REPLACE the placeholder path `C:\\REPLACE\\rudvaya-demo\\pages\\dashboard.html` (and whatsapp.html / simulator.html in WF-04 / WF-07) with the real absolute path on your laptop, e.g. `D:\\automation\\rudvaya-demo\\pages\\dashboard.html`.\n\n**Must be Active** for the dashboard, mock inbox and CSV form links in the dashboard header to resolve, since production webhook URLs only work while the workflow is Active.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "f0000000-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky: Credentials & Paths",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
